{"seq":2,"slug":"cache-db-consistency","title":"Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/cache-db-consistency","wordCount":2144,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"redis-缓存与-db-库存对账\">Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当 Redis 参与扣减（见 <a href=\"../deduct-reserve/oversell-defense\">防超卖：DB 条件更新 vs Redis 原子扣减</a>）或承载预占（见 <a href=\"../deduct-reserve/reserve-confirm-release\">预占/确认扣减/释放三段状态</a> 的路线二），系统就有了两个记录库存的地方。这不是设计缺陷，而是性能的必然代价。真正的问题是：<strong>这两个数字会分离，而分离本身不会报警</strong>。</p>\n<p>分离的原因有五类，它们的危险程度和修复方式各不相同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>正常在途。</strong> Redis 扣减成功、落库异步进行中，两者相差几分钟的写入量。这是设计内的差异，不应报警。</li>\n<li><strong>落库失败。</strong> Redis 扣了、数据库写失败（网络抖动、主键冲突、超时），差异永久化且方向是「Redis 低、DB 高」——表现为少卖，安全方向。</li>\n<li><strong>Redis 数据丢失。</strong> 未持久化重启、主从切换丢掉未同步的写、误执行 <code>FLUSHDB</code>。差异方向是「Redis 高、DB 低」——<strong>这是超卖方向，最危险</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>旁路写入。</strong> 有人直接改了数据库库存（运营调整、修复脚本），Redis 不知道。方向取决于改法。</li>\n<li><strong>释放/确认丢失。</strong> <code>reserved</code> 在一边归还了、另一边没归还。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对账的任务是：<strong>周期性地计算两边差异，把差异按原因分类，只对确认是泄漏的部分做安全修复，并且让每一次修复都可审计</strong>。对账不是「把 Redis 刷成数据库的值」——那样做会在大促期间把正在进行的在途扣减全部抹掉，直接超卖。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异来源</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>是否危险</th>\n<th>自动修复</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常在途写</td>\n<td>不确定</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>不处理</td>\n<td>水位线之内的写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落库失败</td>\n<td>Redis 低</td>\n<td>否（少卖）</td>\n<td>可自动上调</td>\n<td>流水存在但 DB 无记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis 数据丢失</td>\n<td>Redis 高</td>\n<td><strong>是（超卖）</strong></td>\n<td>需人工确认</td>\n<td>快照与流水都对不上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旁路写入 DB</td>\n<td>Redis 低</td>\n<td>否（少卖）</td>\n<td>可自动上调</td>\n<td>DB 侧有变更日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>释放/确认丢失</td>\n<td>不确定</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>重算 <code>reserved</code> 收敛</td>\n<td>预占表与主表不等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;定时/手动触发对账&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;读取 DB 真相&lt;br/&gt;inventory 表 + reservation 表&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;读取 Redis 快照&lt;br/&gt;桶值 MGET 或汇总 key&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;计算 diff&lt;br/&gt;diff = redis_avail - db_avail&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;diff 分类&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;|diff| &lt; 阈值&quot;| F[&quot;正常:记录指标,不动&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;diff &lt; -阈值&lt;br/&gt;Redis 低&quot;| G[&quot;少卖方向&lt;br/&gt;可自动上调(安全)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;diff &gt; 阈值&lt;br/&gt;Redis 高&quot;| H[&quot;超卖方向&lt;br/&gt;必须人工确认&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;审计表记录&lt;br/&gt;原因/操作者/前后值&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; J[&quot;冻结该 SKU 的 Redis 扣减&lt;br/&gt;切回 DB 路线 + 告警&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"定时/手动触发对账\"] --&gt; B[\"读取 DB 真相&lt;br/&gt;inventory 表 + reservation 表\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"读取 Redis 快照&lt;br/&gt;桶值 MGET 或汇总 key\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"计算 diff&lt;br/&gt;diff = redis_avail - db_avail\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"diff 分类\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"|diff| &lt; 阈值\"| F[\"正常:记录指标,不动\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"diff &lt; -阈值&lt;br/&gt;Redis 低\"| G[\"少卖方向&lt;br/&gt;可自动上调(安全)\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"diff &gt; 阈值&lt;br/&gt;Redis 高\"| H[\"超卖方向&lt;br/&gt;必须人工确认\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"审计表记录&lt;br/&gt;原因/操作者/前后值\"]\n    H --&gt; J[\"冻结该 SKU 的 Redis 扣减&lt;br/&gt;切回 DB 路线 + 告警\"]</pre><p>分类阈值的设定是判据的核心。阈值太小会把在途写误判为泄漏，阈值太大则泄漏会累积到无法挽回。合理做法是<strong>用两套判据</strong>：绝对值阈值（例如 50 件）与相对阈值（例如可售量的 5%），取较大者；同时要求差异在连续两次对账中都超过阈值才升级为泄漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"如何拿到-redis-的真相\">如何拿到「Redis 的真相」</h2><p>对账的第一个技术难点是：Redis 里的库存分布可能已经被分桶（见 <a href=\"hot-sku-deduction\">热点 SKU 分桶扣减与合并</a>）。要拿到总量必须合并。</p>\n<p><strong>方式一：扫描所有桶 key。</strong> 用 <code>SCAN</code> 匹配 <code>inv:{sku}:{wh}:b*</code> 再 <code>MGET</code>。<code>SCAN</code> 的代价高且会重复返回（官方保证一次完整迭代一定返回迭代期间始终存在的所有元素、且绝不返回期间不存在的元素，但同一元素可能被返回多次，来源：Redis Docs — SCAN, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/scan/），对账任务不应在大促期间全量扫描。\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/scan/），对账任务不应在大促期间全量扫描。</a></p>\n<p><strong>方式二：维护汇总 key。</strong> 每次桶内扣减成功后，用 Lua 同时更新汇总 key。汇总 key 是单点，会成为新的热点——但对账是低频操作，可以把汇总 key 的更新改为「每 N 次扣减更新一次」的抽样累计，容忍小误差。</p>\n<p><strong>方式三：从流水重建。</strong> 最可靠的方式是不信任 Redis 的存量值，而是从扣减流水（<code>KEYS[2]</code> 那样的幂等记录，或独立的扣减日志表）重算。流水的优势是它与业务动作一一对应，可追溯到订单。代价是重算需要读大量记录。</p>\n<p>实践中通常组合使用：日常用汇总 key 做快速比对（秒级发现明显偏差），每日低峰期用流水重建做精确对账（可以定位到具体订单）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"以数据库为基准的收敛\">以数据库为基准的收敛</h2><p>对账的方向必须是<strong>单向的</strong>：以数据库为真相，向 Redis 收敛。理由是在 DB 路线下数据库是真相源，而在 Redis 路线下数据库仍然是最终账（它有事务、有 binlog、有备份，而 Redis 的持久化保证更弱——默认 RDB 快照可能丢失最近数分钟数据，默认 AOF 的 <code>appendfsync everysec</code> 也可能丢失最多一秒写入，来源：Redis Docs — Redis persistence, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/management/persistence/）。\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/management/persistence/）。</a></p>\n<p>上调 Redis（Redis 低、DB 高）是安全的：它把少卖的额度还回去，最坏情况是多卖了几件到「DB 认为可行」的水平——而 DB 是对的。</p>\n<p>下调 Redis（Redis 高、DB 低）是危险的：它可能在大促期间把正在进行的扣减抹掉，也可能掩盖真实的超卖。必须要求人工确认，且确认前应当先<strong>抑制该 SKU 的 Redis 扣减路径</strong>，防止在修复窗口里继续超卖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type DiffDecision = { action: &#39;none&#39; } | { action: &#39;raise&#39;; qty: number } | { action: &#39;hold&#39;; reason: string };&#10;&#10;function classify(redisAvail: number, dbAvail: number, ratio: number, absFloor: number): DiffDecision {&#10;  const diff = redisAvail - dbAvail;&#10;  const threshold = Math.max(absFloor, Math.floor(dbAvail * ratio));&#10;  if (Math.abs(diff) &lt;= threshold) return { action: &#39;none&#39; };&#10;  if (diff &lt; 0) return { action: &#39;raise&#39;, qty: -diff };&#10;  return { action: &#39;hold&#39;, reason: `redis higher than db by ${diff}` };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiffDecision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'raise'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">redisAvail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dbAvail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">absFloor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiffDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redisAvail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dbAvail;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(absFloor, Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbAvail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(diff) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'raise'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, qty: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">diff };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`redis higher than db by ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段逻辑刻意把「下调」排除在自动动作之外。所有自动修复都只能往安全方向走，这是对账系统最重要的设计约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途写与时间窗\">在途写与时间窗</h2><p>对账最大的误判来源是把「在途」当成「泄漏」。解决方式有两个。</p>\n<p><strong>方式一：水位线（watermark）。</strong> 在读取 Redis 快照前记录一个 <code>sync_seq</code>（数据库侧的最后已落库序号），然后只统计「序号小于等于该水位线」的 Redis 操作。这样在途写被排除在对比之外。</p>\n<p><strong>方式二：滞后读取。</strong> 比较 <code>db_avail</code> 与「T 秒之前」的 Redis 快照。用时间换准确性，实现简单。缺点是 T 秒内的真实泄漏会被延后一个周期才发现，这在可接受范围内。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant W as 扣减写路径&#10;    participant R as Redis&#10;    participant MQ as 落库队列&#10;    participant DB as 数据库&#10;    participant REC as 对账任务&#10;    W-&gt;&gt;R: 扣减 (t0)&#10;    R--&gt;&gt;W: left=1234&#10;    W-&gt;&gt;MQ: 发送扣减事件 (t0)&#10;    MQ-&gt;&gt;DB: 写入流水 (t0+200ms)&#10;    Note over REC: t1 时刻开始对账&#10;    REC-&gt;&gt;DB: 读 watermark = max(seq)&#10;    REC-&gt;&gt;R: 读快照 (含 t0 之后的写)&#10;    REC-&gt;&gt;REC: 用 watermark 过滤掉未落库的写&#10;    REC-&gt;&gt;REC: 分类 diff\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant W as 扣减写路径\n    participant R as Redis\n    participant MQ as 落库队列\n    participant DB as 数据库\n    participant REC as 对账任务\n    W-&gt;&gt;R: 扣减 (t0)\n    R--&gt;&gt;W: left=1234\n    W-&gt;&gt;MQ: 发送扣减事件 (t0)\n    MQ-&gt;&gt;DB: 写入流水 (t0+200ms)\n    Note over REC: t1 时刻开始对账\n    REC-&gt;&gt;DB: 读 watermark = max(seq)\n    REC-&gt;&gt;R: 读快照 (含 t0 之后的写)\n    REC-&gt;&gt;REC: 用 watermark 过滤掉未落库的写\n    REC-&gt;&gt;REC: 分类 diff</pre><p>第三种易被忽略的误判来源是<strong>时钟</strong>。如果 <code>expire_at</code> 用应用服务器时间写入，而释放任务用另一台服务器的时间判断，两台机器的时钟偏差会让释放提前或延后。对所有涉及时间的判定，要么统一用数据库时间（<code>NOW(3)</code>），要么用统一的时钟源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"修复的可审计性\">修复的可审计性</h2><p>每一次对账修复都必须记录到一张审计表，字段包括：<code>sku_id</code>、<code>warehouse_id</code>、<code>before_redis</code>、<code>before_db</code>、<code>diff_class</code>、<code>action</code>、<code>operator</code>（<code>auto</code> 或具体人）、<code>reason</code>、<code>created_at</code>。这张表的作用不是合规，而是<strong>调试</strong>：当同一 SKU 连续多天出现同类差异时，审计表能立刻回答「是每次都自动修了，还是从来没修成功」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE inventory_reconcile_log (&#10;  id            BIGINT      NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;  sku_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  warehouse_id  INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  before_redis  INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  before_db     INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  diff          INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  diff_class    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  action        VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  operator      VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  reason        VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at    DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (id),&#10;  KEY idx_sku_time (sku_id, warehouse_id, created_at)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory_reconcile_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  before_redis  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  before_db     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_class    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operator      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">255</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_sku_time (sku_id, warehouse_id, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>反复出现的差异必须升级为解决根因问题。</strong> 如果每天自动上调 Redis 一万次，说明落库链路有系统性丢事件，自动修复只是在掩盖症状。判据是：同一 <code>diff_class</code> 的日均次数趋势应下降；若持平或上升，需要排查落库队列的失败率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"reserved-的对账与-已释放未归还\">reserved 的对账与「已释放未归还」</h2><p><code>available</code> 的对账相对直接，<code>reserved</code> 的对账更容易出错，因为它涉及预占表与库存主表两个地方。恒等式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>主表</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">reserved_{主表} = \\sum_{r \\in RS} quantity(r), \\quad RS = \\{r \\mid status(r) = RESERVED\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">主表</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>任何一次释放都是「先改状态、再改主表」，两步之间崩溃会留下「状态是 RELEASED 但主表 <code>reserved</code> 未减」的泄漏。重算式对账可以直接收敛它：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE inventory i&#10;JOIN (&#10;  SELECT sku_id, warehouse_id, SUM(quantity) AS qty&#10;  FROM inventory_reservation WHERE status = &#39;RESERVED&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY sku_id, warehouse_id&#10;) r ON i.sku_id = r.sku_id AND i.warehouse_id = r.warehouse_id&#10;SET i.reserved = r.qty&#10;WHERE i.reserved &lt;&gt; r.qty;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, warehouse_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quantity) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_reservation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, warehouse_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">warehouse_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">warehouse_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reserved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reserved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个重算把预占表当作真相，因为它有状态机与唯一键，语义比主表的汇总值更明确。注意重算必须避开正在进行的预占创建（新建的预占行已在表中，所以它是包含在真相里的），因此这条 SQL 是安全的；危险的是把它用在有分库分表或跨库事务的场景，那时需要按分片分别重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双真相源是性能的必然代价，对账不是可选运维动作，而是这套架构的必需组成部分。</li>\n<li>差异必须按原因分类：正常在途、落库失败、Redis 丢失、旁路写入、释放丢失。只有分类后的差异才可修复。</li>\n<li>对账方向单向：以数据库为基准向 Redis 收敛。自动修复只允许往安全方向（上调 Redis）走，下调必须人工确认并先抑制 Redis 扣减。</li>\n<li>在途写要靠水位线或滞后读取排除，否则每次对账都会误判出大量假泄漏。</li>\n<li>每次修复必须写入审计表；同类差异反复出现时，修复动作本身就是一个待解决的根因问题。</li>\n<li><code>reserved</code> 的对账应以预占表为真相重算主表，因为预占表有状态机与唯一键，语义更明确。</li>\n<li>下一步：活动期间额度如何预先切分与备货，见 <a href=\"pre-deduction-stockup\">预扣库存与活动备货</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账","id":"redis-缓存与-db-库存对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"如何拿到「Redis 的真相」","id":"如何拿到-redis-的真相"},{"level":2,"text":"以数据库为基准的收敛","id":"以数据库为基准的收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"在途写与时间窗","id":"在途写与时间窗"},{"level":2,"text":"修复的可审计性","id":"修复的可审计性"},{"level":2,"text":"reserved 的对账与「已释放未归还」","id":"reserved-的对账与-已释放未归还"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"热点 SKU 分桶扣减与合并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/hot-sku-deduction"},"next":{"title":"预扣库存与活动备货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/pre-deduction-stockup"}}